      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEETO (5) continued the good recent form when he finished second, beaten less than a length, last time out over 1650m at this track. Going well without winning but looks suited in this contest and gains the services of Willie Pike. JAVELIN STRIKE (4) produced a solid effort last time when fourth over 1400m at this track. Won't be bothered by this longer journey and is nearing peak fitness now third-up. POLYVANOVA (1) doesn't win out of turn, scoring just three times from 30 starts, but did a good job last start to finish second over 1300m at this track, beaten 1.2 lengths. Meeting a tougher field but on her best form she is capable of a big performance. GRANDAD'S ADICTION (6) registered a strong win two runs ago then turned in a nice run last time out when fourth over 1700m at this track, beaten 2.25 lengths. Ultra consistent, so must be respected and draws well. CAPABLE ANGEL (7) is another who doesn't have the best strike rate but wasn't far off them last start.",
